{"id":"P16","title":"Los likes, en acción","metrics":[{"id":"fam","label":"Likes a su foto","unit":"/s"},{"id":"row","label":"Escrituras a su fila","unit":"/s","better":"low"},{"id":"key","label":"Lecturas de su clave","unit":"/s","better":"low"},{"id":"dup","label":"Perdidos o dobles","better":"low"}],"goals":[{"text":"Por qué el like no toca el contador","step":1},{"text":"Cómo 1.700 likes se vuelven una escritura","step":2},{"text":"Qué frena 50.000 lecturas a una clave","step":3},{"text":"Cómo aguanta el pico de un famoso","step":4},{"text":"Por qué no se cuenta dos veces tras un fallo","step":5}],"steps":[{"short":"Dar like","chapter":"solution","title":"El like, primero en la tabla de verdad","body":"`PUT …/likes/me` va al shard del usuario. El `INSERT … ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING` solo devuelve fila si el like es nuevo, y en la misma transacción deja un `+1` en el outbox. Un publicador lo lleva al log. El contador no se toca.","changes":["+ Tabla likes, por user_id","+ Outbox → log"],"metrics":{"fam":1700,"dup":0},"nodes":[{"id":"usr","kind":"users","label":"Usuarios","at":[1.5,0]},{"id":"wapi","kind":"service","label":"API likes","at":[0.5,1.2]},{"id":"rapi","kind":"service","label":"API lectura","at":[2.5,1.2],"state":"dim"},{"id":"likes","kind":"db","label":"likes+outbox","at":[0,2.4],"note":"por user_id","mark":"good"},{"id":"log","kind":"stream","label":"Log","at":[1,2.4]},{"id":"cache","kind":"cache","label":"Redis","at":[2.5,2.4],"state":"dim"},{"id":"agg","kind":"worker","label":"Agregador","at":[1.5,3.6],"state":"dim"},{"id":"cnt","kind":"db","label":"post_counters","at":[2.5,3.6],"state":"dim"}],"links":[{"id":"usr-wapi","from":"usr","to":"wapi"},{"id":"usr-rapi","from":"usr","to":"rapi","state":"dim"},{"id":"wapi-likes","from":"wapi","to":"likes"},{"id":"likes-log","from":"likes","to":"log"},{"id":"log-agg","from":"log","to":"agg","state":"dim"},{"id":"agg-cnt","from":"agg","to":"cnt","state":"dim"},{"id":"agg-cache","from":"agg","to":"cache","state":"